.KEY line/F
; WiiStation (PlayStation emulator) for WarpOS on Radeon 9200 (MiniGL R200).
; Run from the WiiStation directory:  Execute WiiStation-R200 [image] [Key=value ...]
; The whole line goes to WiiStation as typed (quote an image path with spaces):
; a template of separate keys would read Core=1 as a keyword assignment.
; With no image an ASL requester asks for one.
; Boot protocol: cold boot, C:InitPPC once, then this script.
FailAt 21
Delete ENV:MGLPPC_LEASE QUIET
; MINIGL_CTILE stays unset: GlesGpu reads the framebuffer back, and a tiled
; render target reads back scrambled.
Delete ENV:MINIGL_CTILE QUIET
SetEnv MGLPPC_NOALTIVEC 1
; The PPC emits the GPU command stream: also what MiniGL's B-F blending and
; 2x texture scale need.
SetEnv MGLPPC_CPEMIT 1
SetEnv MGLPPC_HOSTPRI -1
; GPU-side present copy: the back buffer keeps its pixels after a present,
; as the Wii's EFB does.
SetEnv MGLPPC_CPPRESENT 1
Stack 65536
Run >NIL: minigl_ppc_host >NIL:
Wait 6
Stack 1048576
WiiStation <line>
